      "content": "the settling of dust... that’s exactly it. it feels like nothing would even matter in the end. if i just stopped existing, the world would just keep turning without me, wouldn't it? would the dust just settle in my place? i just want the noise to stop for good. not just a weekend or a vacation, but for real.",
